<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>About Us</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #2364aa;
      --accent: #3da5d9;
      --highlight: #ffcd38;
      --background: #f4f9fa;
      --neutral: #22223b;
      --favorite: #f43f5e;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
      background: var(--background);
      color: var(--neutral);
      line-height: 1.6;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .main-container {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 36px 30px;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px 0 rgba(35, 100, 170, 0.09);
    }

    nav {
      text-align: right;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    nav a {
      color: var(--primary);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-left: 24px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
    }
    nav a:hover {
      background: var(--highlight);
      color: #1e293b;
    }

    .main-heading {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      color: var(--primary);
      font-weight: 900;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .subtitle {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 500;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    #mission {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--highlight) 0%, #fff9ea 100%);
      border-left: 8px solid var(--primary);
      padding: 22px 30px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      margin: 36px 0 42px 0;
    }
    #mission h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: var(--primary);
    }
    #mission p {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      font-size: 1.14em;
    }

    section {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    ul.movies {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
      margin-top: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }
    ul.movies li {
      background: hsl(199 89% 90%);
      color: var(--primary);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      font-weight: 500;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px #3da5d920;
      position: relative;
      transition: box-shadow 0.2s;
    }
    ul.movies li::before {
      content: "★";
      color: #f7af3e;
      position: absolute;
      left: 10px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      font-size: 1.1em;
      opacity: 0.5;
    }
    ul.movies .favorite-movie {
      background: linear-gradient(105deg, var(--favorite) 63%, #fff 140%);
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: bold;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px #f43f5e22;
      border: 2px solid var(--favorite);
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    ul.movies .favorite-movie::before {
      content: "❤";
      color: #fff;
      left: 16px;
      opacity: 1;
    }

    ol.cities {
      counter-reset: cities;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    ol.cities li {
      list-style: none;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #e0ecf6 0 70%, #f4f9fa 90%);
      border-radius: 13px;
      padding: 15px 22px 15px 58px;
      position: relative;
      transition: background 0.3s, color 0.3s;
      font-size: 1.09em;
      color: var(--neutral);
    }
    ol.cities li::before {
      counter-increment: cities;
      content: counter(cities);
      position: absolute;
      left: 17px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 50%;
      font-size: 1.1em;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 7px #2364aa16;
    }
    ol.cities li:nth-child(1) {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffe6c6 0 60%, #fff 110%);
      color: #b4690e;
      font-size: 1.15em;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    ol.cities li:nth-child(2) {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #d2ffec 0 70%, #f4f9fa 100%);
      color: #308477;
      border-left: 7px solid var(--accent);
      font-style: italic;
    }
    ol.cities li:nth-child(3) {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #e0e0f7 0 77%, #fff 110%);
      color: #5350b9;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      .main-container { padding: 18px 4vw; }
      ul.movies { flex-direction: column; }
      ul.movies li, ul.movies .favorite-movie { padding: 12px 18px; min-width: 0; }
      ol.cities li { padding-left: 48px; font-size: 1em; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="main-container">
    <nav>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#mission">Mission</a>
      <a href="mailto:info@company.com">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <h1 class="main-heading" id="about">About Us</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">
      We blend creativity, empathy, and technology to drive meaningful growth.
    </div>
    <section>
      <p>
        Our passionate team delivers results with innovation and dedication.<br>
        We strive for positive change and lasting partnerships anchored by transparency.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section id="mission">
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>
        To empower organizations and people through reliable solutions and continuous progress.<br>
        Connect with us at <a href="mailto:info@company.com">info@company.com</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3>Favorite Movies</h3>
      <ul class="movies">
        <li>Inception</li>
        <li class="favorite-movie">Spirited Away</li>
        <li>Interstellar</li>
        <li>The Godfather</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3>Cities to Visit</h3>
      <ol class="cities">
        <li>Kyoto</li>
        <li>Barcelona</li>
        <li>Reykjavik</li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
